340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 681 0 R
/E (To play the Snake game in solo mode, you use the WASD keys to move the snake around the playing area. As you find food, your snake can eat it to grow larger. The game ends when the snake either moves off the boundaries or collides with self. The goal is to make the snake as large as possible before that happens. When you start your game in this mode the snake first appears in the middle of the grid. To make the snake move faster different speeds can be selected before the game starts.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
