357 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 683 0 R
/E (To play the Snake game in two player mode, player one uses the WASD keys and player two uses the IJKL keys to move their snake around the playing area. Both players compete to collect apples, grow their respective snakes and increase the probability of player 2 running into player 1's body or vice versa. Each player has the freedom to utilize any strategy they want, but to win the game, only one straightforward objective must be achieved, simply outlast your opponent. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
